contentText:
Yann Pissenem and Sam Mooney , two key members of the team behind Ibiza mega-clubs Hï, Ushuaïa and [UNVRS], have launched a new creative agency called The Ideation Bureau.

Pissenem and Mooney will take their real-world expertise and apply it to projects, with The Ideation Bureau set to work across brand strategy, identity and design systems, creative direction, campaign development and content production, with a goal of building and operating brands. Pissenem is The Ideation Bureau&#8217;s founder and CEO, with Mooney serving as founder and chief creative officer.

